1. She was a struggling university student who had little money. (Verbatim: "I was a struggling uni student okay okay students do not have much money")

2. She bought a very large bag of pasta in bulk to save money during university. (Verbatim: "I bought a mahoosive a mahoosive bag of pasta okay... this is gonna feed me for the entire year")

3. A rodent infestation destroyed her entire bulk pasta supply by chewing through the bag and stealing all the pasta. (Verbatim: "it was gone the whole thing every bit of pasta... there was a big hole at the bottom which had been numbed open... there was a lot of poop around as well")

4. She was deeply upset by the loss of her pasta, to the point of crying. (Verbatim: "and then I cried")

5. She stopped using the cupboard where the pasta was stored after the infestation. (Verbatim: "I never put anything in that cupboard ever again")

6. She could hear rodents moving inside the walls, which she found creepy but also somewhat cute. (Verbatim: "sometimes I could hear them in the walls that was also kawaii... it's scary they're like oh gosh")

7. She once recruited a campus cat to help deal with a rodent problem. (Verbatim: "I recruited the campus cat to stay with me... I guess it was a kind of solution")

8. She has previously dealt with bats entering her space, which she found difficult because they fly. (Verbatim: "yeah bats I've had bats before inside but bats are difficult because they fly")

9. Her debut date had been postponed multiple times, causing her significant stress and emotional distress. (Verbatim: "it got changed so many times so so so so so many times... if we had to move it again I was gonna cry")

10. She felt immense joy and relief when finally announcing her official debut date. (Verbatim: "i have no idea how much joy how much joy i had in just telling you like finally being able to tell you an actual debut day") [end of text]



